---
// Layout
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Discover the Pomodoro technique and how our app helps you maximize productivity with deep focus sessions."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16 py-4">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="text-center space-y-4 py-8">
      <div class="text-6xl mb-2">🍅</div>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-foreground dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        The Pomodoro Technique
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        A simple yet powerful method to improve your focus and productivity.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- What is Pomodoro -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        What is the Pomodoro Technique?
      </h2>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">
          The Pomodoro Technique was created by <span
            class="font-semibold text-primary">Francesco Cirillo</span
          > in the late 1980s. The name comes from the tomato-shaped kitchen timer
          (pomodoro in Italian) he used during university.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">
          This technique breaks work into <span
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 px-3 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary"
          >25-minute</span> intervals called "pomodoros", separated by short breaks. It's perfect
          for fighting procrastination and maintaining focus.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it Works -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        How Does it Work?
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">1</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Choose a task</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Select the task you want to work on. It can be anything: studying,
            coding, writing, designing...
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">2</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Work for 25 minutes</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Focus completely on your task for 25 minutes. No distractions, no
            social media, no multitasking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">3</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Take a 5-minute break</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Take a short break. Stand up, stretch, drink water. Let your mind
            relax.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-xs font-bold text-primary">4</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">Repeat and long break</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            After 4 pomodoros, take a longer break of 15-30 minutes. You've
            earned it!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- App Features -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        App Features
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Smart Timer</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Automatically alternates between work and rest. Set your available
            time and start.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"></path>
              <path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Notifications</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Get sound alerts when each session ends. Never lose your rhythm.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M3 3v18h18"></path>
              <path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Detailed Stats</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Visualize your weekly and daily performance. See how much real
            time you spend on each task.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
              <path
                d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Multilingual</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Available in Spanish and English. Switch languages anytime.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">Responsive</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Works perfectly on mobile, tablet, and desktop. Take your
            productivity everywhere.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-1">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path
                d="M19 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"
              ></path>
              <polyline points="17 21 17 13 7 13 7 21"></polyline>
              <polyline points="7 3 7 8 15 8"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground">History & Sync</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Save your progress automatically. Analyze your sessions and keep
            track over time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Benefits -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Benefits of Using Pomodoro
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Improves concentration</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Short intervals help you maintain focus without mental exhaustion.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m12 14 4-4"></path>
              <path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Reduces procrastination</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              25 minutes is a manageable commitment. It's easier to start when
              you know it's temporary.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path
                d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3-4-4-6.5c-1 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5s-3 3.5-3 5.5a7 7 0 0 0 7 7Z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Prevents burnout</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Regular breaks prevent exhaustion and keep your energy high.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4 items-start p-5 bg-card border border-border/60 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-primary/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shrink-0">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-foreground">Increases productivity</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Working in short sprints makes you more efficient and time-aware.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="text-center py-6">
      <div
        class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/10 via-card to-card border border-border/60 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
          Ready to be more productive?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-muted-foreground max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Start your first Pomodoro now and experience the difference in your workflow.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-3">
          <a
            href="/en"
            class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02]"
          >
            Start Now
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="h-4 w-4"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
